        <Text align="left" auto_resize="height" blend_mode="normal" content="Panels can be persistent or toggled in and out, depending on the application’s needs. On desktop and tablet, panels are located on either side of the application frame (left or right) or both. Panels come in two different widths: 304 px and 240 px. This panel area can house a single panel or a panel group (multiple panels stacked vertically). On phones, panels are located at the bottom and take up the full width of the screen." id="01M4V5T780HTKZ5SBXW7N60PDT" layout_child={{"align_self": "stretch"}} local_size={[950.0, 112.0]} meta={{"figma_id": "349:41488", "figma_type": "TEXT"}} name="Panels can be persistent or toggled in and out, depending on the application’s needs. On desktop and tablet, panels are located on either side of the application frame (left or right) or both. Panels come in two different widths: 304 px and 240 px. This panel area can house a single panel or a panel group (multiple panels stacked vertically). On phones, panels are located at the bottom and take up the full width of the screen." opacity={1.0} style={{"color": fnxColor("#222222"), "font_family": "Source Sans Pro", "italic": false, "letter_spacing": 0.0, "line_height": 1.399999976158142, "size_px": 20.0, "weight": 400}} vertical_align="center" x={96.0} y={2224.0} />
